      "value": "Hi @{64bc6180a9390b09b2a713bc|full_name}, it seems like you've posted a support request to the incorrect channel. This feature request board on VRChat Feedback is for people asking for features such as avatar audio on mobile platforms or declaring generative AI content.\n\nFor isolated issues or customer support visit help.vrchat.com - for user support ask in Discord or at [VRChat Ask](https://ask.vrchat.com/) forum.\n\nDuplicate of:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/doest-load-worlds\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/i-cant-switch-worlds\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/stuck-in-loading-screen-1\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/vrchat-home-and-instance-bug",
