  "details": "Hello VRChat Support,\n\nI'm having an issue where VRChat is unable to load any worlds or avatars.\n\nThe game gets stuck on the loading screen at 0.00% (0 B / 0 B) and never starts downloading the world. This happens on both my Meta Quest 2 and my PC (Steam version).\n\nThings I have already tried:\n\nRestarting my Quest 2 and PC\n\nReinstalling VRChat\n\nClearing all VRChat data and cache\n\nLogging out and back in\n\nUsing my home Wi-Fi\n\nUsing a mobile hotspot\n\nChanging my avatar to a default avatar\n\nChanging my Home World\n\nChecking that my system date and time are correct\n\nVerifying that I have plenty of free storage space (over 170 GB)\n\nMy VRChat account works normally on the website, and I can log in successfully. However, once I launch the game, worlds never load and remain at 0 B / 0 B indefinitely.\n\nThe issue started suddenly. VRChat was working normally earlier the same day, and a few hours later it stopped loading any content.\n\nCould you please help me identify the cause of this problem?\n\nThank you.",
